                        "sense_id": "5f9eaffb-11fa-3d32-a310-a8c22d3c8c41",
                        "entry_id": "59351296-b2b6-35f3-8607-45b8e8562d00",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person of pure ethnic Chinese ancestry (especially during the Spanish colonial period in the Philippines)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Philippines",
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f967a30-383f-4d2d-8f72-604f66f96fff",
                                "sense_id": "5f9eaffb-11fa-3d32-a310-a8c22d3c8c41",
                                "text": "There were also in this city certain Sangleyes who had settled down there to sell their merchandise, so that they remained there from one year to another."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff249544-5745-4873-82fc-5670a4745d6a",
                                "sense_id": "5f9eaffb-11fa-3d32-a310-a8c22d3c8c41",
                                "text": "They retired to the river of Tan-Chuy, with a prize which they made there, a small champan from China, which came from that kingdom to Hermosa Island to carry supplies and merchandise; in it was traveling a religious of St. Dominic, in the garb of a Sangley."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f245614e-4483-4b7f-a583-1d57546d8b02",
                                "sense_id": "5f9eaffb-11fa-3d32-a310-a8c22d3c8c41",
                                "text": "What arouses my wonder most is, that when I arrived no Sangley knew how to paint anything; but now they have so perfected themselves in this art that they have produced marvelous works with both the brush and the chisel...."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
